SUMMARY:Teen Swim Night: “Almost” Summer Party
DESCRIPTION:Make a splash and welcome summer early at our Teen Swim Night! Join us at North Clackamas Aquatic Park for an evening of music\, contests with prizes\, and plenty of poolside fun. We’ll have beach balls and icy treats to keep the party going. \nSWIM TIMES\nSaturday\, May 16\nGrades 6-8: 6-7:30 p.m.\nGrades 9-12: 8-9:30 p.m. \nSpace is limited — pre-registration is required to save your spot. More at ncprd.org/teen-swim.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/teen-swim-night-almost-summer-party/
