SUMMARY:Oregon International Air Show at Hillsboro
DESCRIPTION:The Show will feature warbirds\, world-class aerobatics and on Friday night only\, their spectacular nighttime finale\, KABOOM! \nFRIDAY: \nGates open at 6pm and close at 10:00pm. \nShow starts APPROXIMATELY at 6:30pm. \nSATURDAY & SUNDAY: \nGates open at 9am and close at 5:00pm. \nShow starts APPROXIMATELY at 12:30pm. \nAdult Admission \nAdult General Admission tickets are good for those aged 12 and up! \nAdult General Admission tickets include ONE ticket to the Air Show for one day. General Admission tickets do not include a seat. Please bring your own low-seated\, low-height chair and/or blanket. \nChild Admission \nChild General Admission tickets are good for those aged 5-11! \nChildren ages 4 and under are free and do not require a ticket for General Admission. \nThis event is over $30. We only include links for higher-priced events from our advertisers — but it’s easy to find with a quick search!
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/oregon-international-air-show-at-hillsboro-2/2026-05-17/
LOCATION:Hillsboro Airport\, 3355 NE Cornell Rd\, Hillsboro\, OR\, 97124\, United States
